*PageRegion w252h81/3.50 x 1.125 in (address label): "<</PageSize[252 81]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w288h468
*ImageableArea w288h468/4.00 x 6.50 in (large label): "0 0 288 468"
*ImageableArea w288h432/4.00 x 6.00 in: "0 0 288 432"
*ImageableArea w288h288/4.00 x 4.00 in: "0 0 288 288"
*ImageableArea w166h288/2.312 x 4.00 in: "0 0 166 288"
*ImageableArea w252h81/3.50 x 1.125 in (address label): "0 0 252 81"
*DefaultPaperDimension: w288h468
*PaperDimension w288h468/4.00 x 6.50 in (large label): "288 468"
