*OpenUI *Resolution/Printer resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 305dpi/305 dpi: "<</HWResolution[305 305]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 609dpi/609 dpi: "<</HWResolution[609 609]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *RIHShift/Horizontal position: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *RIHShift
*DefaultRIHShift: Left5
*RIHShift Left20/20 dots left: ""
*RIHShift Left15/15 dots left: ""
*RIHShift Left10/10 dots left: ""
*RIHShift Left5/5 dots left: ""
*RIHShift Zero/Centered on the print origin (0): ""
*RIHShift Right5/5 dots right: ""
*RIHShift Right10/10 dots right: ""
*RIHShift Right20/20 dots right: ""
*RIHShift Right40/40 dots right: ""
*RIHShift Right80/80 dots right: ""
*CloseUI: *RIHShift

*% Left/Right moves the whole image sideways on the head, in printer dots. The right value depends on the label stock;
*% Left 5 was measured for 2.312 x 4 in labels on a WS408 (see pdftosbpl).
*% End
